{"id":"vod_bf_23776","vodId":"23776","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"魔卡少女樱","name_cn":"魔卡少女樱","date":"1998-01-01","year":"1998","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-24/228605e7f5debf37baa266f14340d439.jpg"},"summary":"小学生木之本樱（丹下樱 配音）是一个平凡的女孩，有一个温柔的爸爸木之本藤隆（田中秀幸 配音）和一个体贴的好友大道寺知世（岩男润子 配音）。一天，在父亲的书房中她发现了一本尘封已久的魔法书，并无意间解除了书上的封印，一只会说话的玩偶可鲁贝洛斯（久川绫 配音）出现在了她的面前。小可告诉她，自己是守护这本书的神兽，书中封印着名叫库洛牌的东西。现在，封印解除了，它要小樱成为库洛魔法师，它将协助她收复这些四处捣乱的库洛牌。隔天，小樱的班上转来了一个名叫李小狼（熊井素子 配音）的转学生，这个外表酷酷的男孩原来也是冲着库洛牌而来。　　随着库洛牌的封印，越来越多的角色出现在了小樱的身边，而他们的真正目的，却还不得而知。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 08:47:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":70,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mokashaonvying/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mokashaonvying/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/mokashaonvying/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/mokashaonvying/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/mokashaonvying/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mokashaonvying/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mokashaonvying/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mokashaonvying/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mokashaonvying/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mokashaonvying/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mokashaonvying/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/mokashaonvying/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/mokashaonvying/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mokashaonvy